OL,3,AA new skyline of data centres is rising
OL,4,Afrom the rolling plains of rural China
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn the expansive grasslands of Inner
OL,7,FMongolia, farmers are picking plump
OL,8,Fpotatoes alongside new neighbours:
OL,9,Fhuge, rectangular blocks that will fuel
OL,10,FChina's AI platforms.
OL,12,FUlanqab, with its steppes and
OL,13,Fvolcanoes, is an unlikely digital
OL,14,Ffrontier. For years, it has been
OL,15,FChina's official "potato capital". But
OL,16,Fnow its fields have also become
OL,17,Fconstruction sites for a slew of data
OL,18,Fcentres, as Donald Trump and his
OL,19,FChinese counterpart Xi Jinping meet to
OL,20,Fdiscuss AI safety among other things.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,108,105,200,160,0,100
