OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AA new skyline of data centres is rising
OL,4,Afrom the rolling plains of rural China
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of workers in yellow helmets
OL,7,Fcarry heavy equipment into the building
OL,8,Fsite as welding sparks fly off metal
OL,9,Fscaffolding. Above them huge cranes
OL,10,Fmove with precision to build rooftops,
OL,11,Fwhile men balance on ladders to plaster
OL,12,Fbrickwork.
OL,14,F"This is China speed," jokes one
OL,15,Fworker. "An infrastructure maniac," is
OL,16,Fhow he describes his country, laughing
OL,17,Fas he walks away. "There is one phase
OL,18,Fevery year. This is the second phase,"
OL,19,Fexplains an electrical engineer. "There
OL,20,Fwill be many more phases afterwards."
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
